# ==============================================================================
# Database: DHCP Option 55 (Parameter Request List - PRL)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Field Schema:
#   Option 55 Sequence | OS Name | Confidence Score (1-99) | Device Type | Vendor
#
# Rules for Adding Entries:
#   1. Specificity Order: Long parameter chains (10+ tokens) MUST be at the top.
#   2. Short generic sequences (e.g. 1,3,6,15,28 or 1,3,6,15) MUST stay at the 
#      very bottom, otherwise they shadow longer device-specific fingerprints.
#
# Example:
#   1,3,6,15,31,33,43,44,46,47,119,121,249,252|Windows (10 / 11)|94|pc|Microsoft
#   1,3,6,15,28|Embedded Linux / lwIP device|58|iot|Unknown
# ==============================================================================

